1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,288
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,288 --> 00:00:03,546
Let's learn about our bodies!

3
00:00:04,096 --> 00:00:05,487
Point with me!

4
00:00:06,837 --> 00:00:08,718
Point to your eyes!

5
00:00:10,318 --> 00:00:11,893
These are my eyes.

6
00:00:11,893 --> 00:00:13,544
I see with my eyes.

7
00:00:14,094 --> 00:00:15,566
Blink, blink!

8
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:18,725
Point to your nose!

9
00:00:20,325 --> 00:00:21,857
This is my nose.

10
00:00:21,857 --> 00:00:23,793
I smell with my nose.

11
00:00:24,343 --> 00:00:25,714
Sniff, sniff!

12
00:00:27,064 --> 00:00:28,778
Point to your mouth!

13
00:00:30,378 --> 00:00:31,774
This is my mouth.

14
00:00:31,774 --> 00:00:34,007
I eat and talk with my mouth.

15
00:00:34,557 --> 00:00:35,988
Yum, yum!

16
00:00:37,338 --> 00:00:39,243
Point to your ears!

17
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:42,402
These are my ears.

18
00:00:42,402 --> 00:00:44,109
I hear with my ears.

19
00:00:44,659 --> 00:00:45,647
Listen!

20
00:00:46,997 --> 00:00:48,878
Point to your hands!

21
00:00:50,478 --> 00:00:52,146
These are my hands.

22
00:00:52,146 --> 00:00:53,966
I clap with my hands.

23
00:00:56,616 --> 00:00:58,402
Point to your feet!

24
00:01:00,002 --> 00:01:01,456
These are my feet.

25
00:01:01,456 --> 00:01:03,671
I walk and jump with my feet.

26
00:01:04,221 --> 00:01:05,652
Stomp, stomp!

27
00:01:07,002 --> 00:01:08,883
Now let's sing it!

28
00:01:09,433 --> 00:01:10,822
Eyes and nose,

29
00:01:10,822 --> 00:01:12,619
and mouth and ears.

30
00:01:12,869 --> 00:01:15,550
Hands and feet, hooray, hooray!

31
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:17,489
Eyes and nose,

32
00:01:17,489 --> 00:01:19,286
and mouth and ears.

33
00:01:19,536 --> 00:01:22,096
Wiggle, wiggle, shake away!

34
00:01:23,446 --> 00:01:25,184
What is this?

35
00:01:26,984 --> 00:01:28,597
My nose!

36
00:01:29,897 --> 00:01:31,635
What is this?

37
00:01:33,435 --> 00:01:34,685
My feet!

38
00:01:35,985 --> 00:01:37,723
What is this?

39
00:01:39,523 --> 00:01:41,217
My ears!

40
00:01:42,567 --> 00:01:44,805
Great job, little learner!

41
00:01:45,355 --> 00:01:47,243
Share Mimzi with a friend,

42
00:01:47,243 --> 00:01:49,783
and subscribe for more learning fun!

43
00:01:50,333 --> 00:01:51,245
Next time,

44
00:01:51,245 --> 00:01:53,841
let's find things around our home.

45
00:01:54,091 --> 00:01:55,462
Bye bye!
